# Conformance probe pack for the rulings of spec 0.7 that the pack
# `conformance-groups-protobuf` does not reach. Public. No kinds.
#
#   field 1   uid
#   field 2   one occurrence per item; an item is a submessage:
#     field 1     label
#     field 3.1   tag, inside a submessage of the item (ruling 13: a path
#                 prefix that is not a submessage is `malformed-wire`)
#     field 4     type; the pack-wide typemap applies inside items (ruling 19)
format  conformance-groups-rulings-protobuf
version 0.7.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    protobuf
field   uid  1  pstring
group   probe.items  2
  field  probe.label  1    pstring
  field  probe.tag    3.1  pstring
  field  type         4    pstring
end
typemap T a-f-G
